# cmd/seed-demo's key -> id map (its default --out). It carries the demo users'
# cleartext passwords and is scratch output of one local seed run. The stray
# binary a bare `go build ./cmd/seed-demo/` drops here is ignored alongside it.
/seed-demo-output.json
/seed-demo
# The scale fixture's generation record (`seed-demo scale --out` default):
# scratch output of one local run, kept next to the fixture for verify --scale.
/seed-demo-scale.json

